03,10504,10505,10506]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-dingfeng"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072","text":"　　異字季文，以父任除郎，後拜騎都尉，代桓領兵，赤烏四年，隨朱然攻魏樊城，建計破其外圍，還拜偏將軍。魏廬江太守文欽營住六安，多設屯寨，置諸道要，以招誘亡叛，為邊寇害。異乃身率其手下二千人，掩破欽七屯，斬首數百，遷揚武將軍。權與論攻戰，辭對稱意。權謂異從父驃騎將軍據曰：「本知季文膽定，見之復過所聞。」十三年，文欽詐降，密書與異，欲令自迎。異表呈欽書，因陳其偽，不可便迎。權詔曰：「方今北土未一，欽云欲歸命，宜且迎之。若嫌其有譎者，但當設計網以羅之，盛重兵以防之耳。」乃遣呂據督二萬人，與異並力，至北界，欽果不降。建興元年，遷鎮南將軍。是歲魏遣胡遵、譜葛誕等出東興，異督水軍攻浮梁，壞之，魏軍大破。太平二年，假節，為大都督，救壽春圍，不解。還軍，為孫綝所枉害。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"異","kind":"person","person_id":"r7q_ie6_ud9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"季文","kind":"person","person_id":"r7q_ie6_ud9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"桓","kind":"person","person_id":"cgf_n3i_i5g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"朱然","kind":"person","person_id":"tut_0t1_tb8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"文欽","kind":"person","person_id":"d07_f6c_af4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"異","kind":"person","person_id":"r7q_ie6_ud9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"欽","kind":"person","person_id":"d07_f6c_af4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"權","